Acknowledgement

dsh-work-status started as a fork of dsh-agent-activity 0.9.0 by oxygenforce
(https://github.com/oxygenforce/dsh-agent-activity, MIT). Its idea of folding the
session log into one status record shown above the composer inspired this plugin.
From 0.13.0 on, the code has been rewritten and no longer contains code from that
project; releases up to 0.12.6 did, under its MIT terms, and their history remains
in this repository.

Third-party artwork

This plugin ships no artwork from dsh-claude-style. It only reads that theme's
CSS class names (`.dsh-claude-deepy`, `.dsh-claude-crab`) to hide its own chip
and to react to a right-click on the mascot. The mascot images themselves —
including the pixel crab "Clawd", a character of Anthropic — remain with their
respective rights holders; see that repository's LICENSE for the exact terms.

